Package: pdn-mailcast-receiver
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Tom Fanning M0LTE <tom@m0lte.uk>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/packet-net/pdn-mailcast
Description: receiver for GB7RDG's daily packet bulletin transmission
 Listens to GB7RDG's daily bulletin transmission on 40 m, through a sound card
 on your radio or the Wessex web SDR, rebuilds each bulletin from the pieces
 it hears, and hands it to your local LinBPQ or FBB mail as a forwarding
 partner would. It never transmits. Self-contained: it bundles its own .NET
 runtime and pdn-soundmodem's MS110D modem.
